{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Forward\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, vaporwave-inspired movement shooter where style meets speed. Play as Dizzy to dash, blast, and grapple through glitchy neon worlds in time-based levels that reward precision, flow, and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you beat the clock before the system flatlines?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide into Action:\u00a0</strong>Defy gravity with wall-running and smooth sliding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.poster.avif?t=1758418064\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.webm?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.mp4?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunplay in Motion:\u00a0</strong>Unload on enemies while moving at high velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/5783694dede6e39f8408d931261d1cd5.poster.avif?t=1758418064\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/5783694dede6e39f8408d931261d1cd5.webm?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/5783694dede6e39f8408d931261d1cd5.mp4?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Frontiers:\u00a0</strong>Explore a multitude of themed sections throughout this glitchy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/19723536101c37839853dda8ba1c8741.poster.avif?t=1758418064\" aria-label=\"Intense Action\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/19723536101c37839853dda8ba1c8741.webm?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/19723536101c37839853dda8ba1c8741.mp4?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was made by a group of students at Lake Washington Institute of Technology.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999640?t=1758418064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999640?t=1758418064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/4052dbbabc1c9170d5f1034af4215337de02d4b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758418064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/4052dbbabc1c9170d5f1034af4215337de02d4b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758418064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":